# UI Specification Rules

## UI Framework & Libraries

### Core Framework
- **Tailwind CSS**: Primary styling framework for utility-first CSS
- **Flowbite**: UI component library built on top of Tailwind CSS
- **Alpine.js**: Lightweight JavaScript framework for reactive components

### Chart Libraries
- **Apexcharts.js**: Primary charting library loaded from CDN
- **Fusioncharts.js**: Secondary charting library for specialized chart types

### Additional Libraries (from `main/Index.html`)
- **jQuery**: DOM manipulation and AJAX handling
- **jQuery UI**: Enhanced UI interactions and widgets
- **Popper.js**: Tooltip and popover positioning
- **Tippy.js**: Advanced tooltip library
- **Tingle**: Modal and dialog management

## CDN Dependencies

### CSS Libraries
```html
<!-- Tailwind CSS -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.15/dist/tailwind.min.css" />

<!-- Flowbite -->
<link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flowbite/2.1.1/flowbite.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />

<!-- Tingle Modal -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tingle/0.8.4/tingle.css" />
```

### JavaScript Libraries
```html
<!-- jQuery -->
<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://code.jquery.com/ui/1.13.1/jquery-ui.min.js"></script>

<!-- Flowbite -->
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flowbite/2.1.1/flowbite.min.js"></script>

<!-- Apexcharts -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/apexcharts"></script>

<!-- Alpine.js -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/alpinejs/alpine@v2.x.x/dist/alpine.min.js" defer="true"></script>

<!-- Popper & Tippy -->
<script src="https://unpkg.com/@popperjs/core@2/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/tippy.js@6/dist/tippy-bundle.umd.js"></script>

<!-- Tingle Modal -->
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tingle/0.8.4/tingle.min.js"></script>
```

## Design System

### Color Scheme
- **Theme Support**: Dark/light mode toggle functionality
- **Chart Colors**: Dynamic color schemes based on current theme
- **Brand Colors**: Consistent color palette for professional presentation

### Typography
- **Tailwind Typography**: Utility classes for consistent text styling
- **Responsive Text**: Scalable typography across device sizes
- **Professional Fonts**: Clean, readable fonts suitable for financial data

### Layout Patterns
- **Grid System**: Tailwind CSS grid for responsive layouts
- **Flexbox**: Flexible component layouts
- **Container System**: Consistent spacing and alignment

## Component Architecture

### Dashboard Components
- **Header**: Navigation and branding
- **Filters**: Year selection, client dropdowns, and sliders
- **Charts**: Data visualization components
- **Reports**: Generated report displays
- **Modals**: Dialog boxes for detailed information

### Interactive Elements
- **Dropdowns**: Client and year selection
- **Sliders**: Range selection for data filtering
- **Buttons**: Action triggers with loading states
- **Tooltips**: Information overlays for data points
- **Modals**: Detailed data views and reports

### Responsive Design
- **Mobile-First**: Responsive design starting from mobile breakpoints
- **Breakpoint System**: Tailwind CSS responsive utilities
- **Touch-Friendly**: Optimized for touch interactions on mobile devices

## User Experience Patterns

### Loading States
- **Button Loading**: Visual feedback during data operations
- **Chart Loading**: Skeleton states for chart components
- **Data Loading**: Progress indicators for API calls

### Error Handling
- **Error Messages**: Clear, user-friendly error notifications
- **Fallback States**: Graceful degradation when data is unavailable
- **Validation Feedback**: Real-time validation for user inputs

### Accessibility
- **ARIA Labels**: Proper accessibility attributes
- **Keyboard Navigation**: Full keyboard accessibility
- **Screen Reader Support**: Semantic HTML structure
- **Color Contrast**: WCAG compliant color combinations

## Performance Optimization

### Asset Loading
- **CDN Optimization**: Fast loading from global CDN networks
- **Minified Libraries**: Production-ready minified versions
- **Lazy Loading**: Load components only when needed

### Rendering Performance
- **Efficient DOM Updates**: Minimal DOM manipulation
- **Chart Optimization**: Optimized chart rendering for large datasets
- **Memory Management**: Proper cleanup of chart instances and event listeners
